			icon: "naturescompass:naturescompass"
			title: "A Wider World"
			subtitle: "Nature's Compass, and fifty new biomes"
			description: [
				"&6Oh The Biomes We've Gone&r replaces most of the overworld's biome list with"
				"fifty-odd of its own: bayous, black forests, cika woods, prairies, each with its"
				"own trees and most with their own wood type."
				""
				"A &6Nature's Compass&r finds any of them by name. Right-click it, search for the"
				"biome, and it points at the nearest one and tells you how far it is."
			]
			size: 1.25d
